    (property "Note" "Soldered through the module main board and the iso board, no mated contact (ADR 0023, amended 2026-10-03). Its pin k is the same conductor on both boards; tools/kicad.py check holds the two sheets to that. Pairs: 1-2 PWR_GND, 3-4 ISO_POS12, 5-6 unconnected (the isolation gap), 7-8 ISO_FILT_NEG, 9-10 ISO_FB2. ON THIS BOARD ON THE TOP SIDE (F.Cu), NOT MIRRORED, though its insulator is on the main board: both KiCad top views are panel views. Buy one: this instance is Assembly none, the main board's is the one ordered. hardware/boards/module-iso/README.md" (at 106.68 63.5 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) hide))
