  (text "THE ISO BOARD (ADR 0023 point 2, amended 2026-10-03 by the owner: \"3 boards for module is correct\"): the instrument's isolated supply, U-ISO and its filter, on a board of its own behind the main board. Power-entry's page iso, placed once; J-B2B-ISO, soldered through this board and the main board, carries its four nets, each on two pins, with pins 5-6 left open between the input and the output." (at 40.64 30.48 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid b474b6dc-a1dd-5289-a229-0895c29b16dd))
